OL,3,GNEWSAParking fee rises could
OL,4,A'desecrate' high streets
OL,5,
OL,6,FIncreases to car parking charges could
OL,7,F"desecrate" trade on struggling high
OL,8,Fstreets, councillors have warned.
OL,10,FNew Forest District Council approved
OL,11,Fplans to increase tariffs in its town,
OL,12,Fvillage and coastal car parks from the
OL,13,Fnew year.
OL,15,FLiberal Democrat opposition councillor
OL,16,FHilary Brand said parking was
OL,17,Frepeatedly targeted because it was an
OL,18,F"easy cash cow".
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
